data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSimpleFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasSimpleFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasSimpleFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land \\forall y\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]\\in\\mathcal A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}meas\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasSimpleFunction}_S(f,\\mathcal A,X,Y)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land f\\in Y^X\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land \\forall y\\in\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\;(f^{-1}[\\{y\\}]\\in\\mathcal A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Simplicity is stated for an actual measurable function on a specified measurable space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","